{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21867","headline":"寄旧诗与薛涛因成长句 · 元稹","name":"寄旧诗与薛涛因成长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗篇调态人皆有，细腻风光我独知。\n月夜咏花怜暗澹，雨朝题柳爲敧垂。\n长教碧玉藏深处，总向红牋写自随。\n老大不能收拾得，与君闲似好男儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21867.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21867","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}